@startuml
' PetPals - deployment topology declared in render.yaml (reviewed 2026-11-15).
' This is a configuration view, not proof that production services are healthy.
title PetPals - deployment view (configured; live integration unverified)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
}

node "User device" as Device {
  artifact "Web browser\nReact PWA executes here" as Browser
}

node "Render (configured services)" as Render {
  node "web-frontend\nDocker / Nginx" as Frontend {
    artifact "Vite-built static assets" as Static
  }
  node "api-service\nDocker / Node.js / Express" as Backend {
    artifact "Auth and user profile API\n/health" as API
  }
  database "app-db\nPostgreSQL" as Database
}

cloud "Google Identity\nOpenID Connect" as Google

Browser --> Frontend : HTTPS / pages and assets
Browser ..> Backend : /api/ requests\nproduction routing to verify
Backend --> Database : PostgreSQL connection
Browser --> Google : OAuth navigation / consent
Browser ..> Backend : callback navigation\nafter Google redirect
Backend --> Google : code exchange / ID token verification

note bottom of Render
Configured in render.yaml.
Live service health, migrations,
frontend API proxy and cookie handling
require confirmation.
end note
@enduml
